# Crop Rotation finds Multiversal Passage, whose "as this land enters, choose a basic land type" is asked while the
# card is still in the library it was found in (CR 614.12a): an entry replacement applies before the card moves.
#
# Handed over at that choice rather than answered, so a session can be dealt the position and show that the seat
# being asked can see the card it is being asked about — a library is hidden from everybody, its owner included, and
# the prompt is the only thing revealing this one. See ScriptedPromptVisibilityTests.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Crop Rotation
Plains x5
Multiversal Passage
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Crop Rotation.Cast
Bot1.Search(Multiversal Passage)
[Handover Bot1.Modes]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Step = Main1
Stack = Crop Rotation
Bot1.Battlefield =
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest
Bot1.Library = Multiversal Passage; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
